Problem: Container With Most Water (LC 11)

Pattern: Two Pointers

Approach:

1. Initialize two pointers:
   left = 0
   right = height.size() - 1
2. Initialize maxArea = 0.
3. Calculate the area using the shorter height and width.
4. Update maxArea.
5. If height[left] < height[right], move left++.
6. Otherwise, move right--.
7. Continue until left < right is false.
8. Return maxArea.

Time Complexity: O(n)

Space Complexity: O(1)

